title: The Informer
subtitle: A police spy in a district committee.
new-page: true
tags: event
priority: -1
view-if: {!
if (typeof RG === 'undefined') { return false; }
if (!RG.lw && this.game.scenes.lw_lib) { this._runActions(this.game.scenes.lw_lib.onArrival); }
return !!(RG.lw && RG.lw.ready('informer'));
!}
on-arrival: {!
if (!RG.lw) { this._runActions(this.game.scenes.lw_lib.onArrival); }
RG.lw.fire('informer');
Q.lw_name = RG.pick(['the district treasurer', 'the chairman of the youth group', 'the comrade who runs the duplicating machine', 'a member of the district committee', 'the head of the district\'s red guard']);
!}

= The Informer

For months, the police in **[+ lw_d_name +]** have known too much: the date of every meeting, the names of the speakers, where the leaflets were printed. Now a comrade who works as a cleaner at police headquarters in [+ lw_town +] has seen a receipt for forty marks a month, signed by [+ lw_name +].

He has been in the party since 1918. He carried the banner at the funerals. He has a wife and three children in a flat by the gasworks, and he does not yet know that we know.

- @expose: Expose him publicly.
- @feed: Leave him in place and feed him false information.
- @expel: Expel him quietly.
- @guards: Hand him over to the red guard.

@expose
subtitle: The district learns a hard lesson in the open. The police lose their eyes. The Spartacist way.
on-arrival: {!
RG.district(Q.lw_d, {repression: -5, loyalty: 3});
Q.worker_support += 1;
RG.news('Police informer unmasked in the ' + Q.lw_d_name + ' party');
RG.lw.lean('luxemburgist', 1, 3);
!}

His photograph and the receipt are on the front page of [+ lw_paper +], with the headline "Forty marks a month". He leaves the city within a week. The police find another informer within a month, but it takes them longer.

@feed
subtitle: The police chase shadows for a while. A dangerous game, and the Zentrale's apparatus likes it.
on-arrival: {!
if (Math.random() < 0.7) {
    Q.lw_out = 1;
    RG.district(Q.lw_d, {repression: -10});
} else {
    Q.lw_out = 2;
    RG.district(Q.lw_d, {repression: 4});
}
RG.lw.lean('offensive', 1, 3);
!}

[? if lw_out = 1 : For three months the police raid empty cellars, arrest the wrong printers and stake out meetings that never take place. Then they stop believing him. ?][? if lw_out = 2 : He notices that he is being told different things from everyone else, and goes straight to his handler. The next raid is a big one. ?]

@expel
subtitle: No scandal, no drama. The district is shaken, and some wonder what else nobody told them.
on-arrival: {!
RG.district(Q.lw_d, {repression: -4, loyalty: -2});
Q.unity += 1;
RG.lw.lean('unionist', 1, 2);
!}

He is expelled at a short meeting, for "conduct unworthy of a party member", and the minutes say nothing more. The rumours say a great deal more.

@guards
subtitle: The red guard has its own way with traitors. If it goes too far, the party will pay for it in court.
view-if: offensive_gone = 0 or ultraleft_gone = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.red_guards_loyalty += 4;
if (Math.random() < 0.35) {
    Q.lw_out = 1;
    RG.district(Q.lw_d, {repression: 12, members: -0.03});
    Q.stability -= 1;
    Q.worker_support -= 2;
    RG.news('Body of a police informer found in the canal at ' + Q.lw_town, 2);
} else {
    Q.lw_out = 2;
    RG.district(Q.lw_d, {repression: -6});
}
if (Q.ultraleft_gone) { RG.lw.lean('offensive', 1, 3); } else { RG.lw.lean('ultraleft', 1, 3); }
RG.lw.lean('unionist', -1, -3);
RG.lw.lean('luxemburgist', -1, -3);
!}

[? if lw_out = 1 : He is found in the canal a week later. The police arrest six men of the guard, and the nationalist press writes about the Cheka in [+ lw_town +]. ?][? if lw_out = 2 : The guard gives him a beating in a garden shed and a ticket for the night train. He takes it. Nobody in the district ever informs again, as far as anyone knows. ?]
